@startuml
' 图名：库存预警时序图
' 撰写成员：架构设计智能体
' 对应版本：v1.0

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "商家" as M
participant "商家端前端\nVue3 + ECharts" as FE
participant "网关/鉴权\nSpring Security + JWT" as GW
participant "预警引擎\nWarningEngine" as WE
participant "库存服务\nInventoryService" as IS
participant "定时任务\n@Scheduled" as JOB
database "MySQL 8" as DB

== 阶段一：定时扫描预警（每日 02:00） ==

JOB -> WE : scan() 触发全量扫描
activate WE
WE -> IS : 查询在售商品与库存
activate IS
IS -> DB : SELECT product JOIN inventory WHERE status=1
DB --> IS : 商品与库存列表
IS --> WE : 商品数据
deactivate IS
WE -> DB : 查询近7日销量(order_item)
DB --> WE : 销量数据
loop 每个在售商品
  WE -> WE : 计算临期等级(remainingDays)
  WE -> WE : 计算损耗风险(lossRisk)
  WE -> WE : 计算库存不足(stock<=safetyStock)
  WE -> WE : level = max(三类等级)
  WE -> DB : UPDATE inventory.warning_level
end
WE --> JOB : 扫描完成
deactivate WE

== 阶段二：商家实时查询预警 ==

M -> FE : 打开库存与临期预警页面
FE -> GW : GET /api/merchant/inventory/warnings
activate GW
GW -> IS : 查询本商家预警商品
activate IS
IS -> DB : 查询warning_level>=阈值的库存
DB --> IS : 预警商品列表
IS -> WE : evaluate() 实时重算详情
activate WE
WE -> DB : 读取近7日销量与保质期
DB --> WE : 销量与商品数据
WE --> IS : 预警结果(等级/类型/建议)
deactivate WE
IS --> GW : 预警VO列表(分页)
deactivate IS
GW --> FE : Result(code=0, data=预警分页)
deactivate GW
FE --> M : ECharts展示临期与损耗趋势、预警清单

note over WE, DB
  订单服务与支付模拟在本场景不参与交互
  定时任务结果持久化到inventory.warning_level
  实时查询保证商家看到最新预警
end note

@enduml
